  "goodToKnow": "Die Oberstufe (or gymnasiale Oberstufe) is the upper level of secondary school, usually the last two or three years at a Gymnasium, leading to the Abitur. Students choose Leistungskurse (advanced courses) and Grundkurse (basic courses), and their grades count towards the final mark. The middle years are die Mittelstufe, the first years die Unterstufe. Die Stufe means step or level. Plural: die Oberstufen."
